OL,3,ANvidia reinstates CEO Jensen Huang
OL,4,Aafter affair with alleged spy as Trump
OL,5,Asays 'I made the deal'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe AI giant's board says he's the
OL,8,F"right person" to lead, but some
OL,9,FDemocratic and Republican US lawmakers
OL,10,Fare questioning Huang's return
OL,12,FTrump - who has pushed for Huang's
OL,13,Freinstatement - calls him a "great
OL,14,Fpatriot" and says the US government has
OL,15,F"no reason to believe" his return poses
OL,16,Fa national security risk
OL,18,FHuang says: "I take this responsibility
OL,19,Fwith the greatest humility and renewed
OL,20,Fcommitment" - read his full statement
